<h2>Booking Request Update</h2>

<p>Hello <%= @customer.user.name %>,</p>

<p>Your booking with <strong><%= @vendor.business_name %></strong> for <strong><%= @service.name %></strong> has been declined.</p>

<div class="details-card">
  <h3>Booking Information</h3>
  <ul class="details-list">
    <li><strong>Service:</strong> <%= @service.name %></li>
    <li><strong>Vendor:</strong> <%= @vendor.business_name %></li>
    <li><strong>Requested Date:</strong> <%= format_booking_time(@booking) %></li>
    <li><strong>Status:</strong> Declined</li>
  </ul>
</div>

<p>The vendor is unfortunately unavailable or unable to fulfill this request for the selected date and time.</p>

<div class="button-container">
  <a href="<%= frontend_url('/explore') %>" class="button">Explore Other Vendors</a>
</div>

<p style="margin-top: 24px;">Don't worry! We have many other talented vendors ready to help make your event unforgettable.</p>

<p>Best regards,<br>
<strong>The Ayoj Team</strong></p>
